1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,780
=Episode 5=

5
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,759
What are you doing up there?

6
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:25,919
Luyao told me to keep watch.

7
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:31,120
Have we met somewhere before?

8
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,479
You look really familiar to me.

9
00:02:35,199 --> 00:02:36,599
Where are you guys from?

10
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,120
Liangzhou.

11
00:02:38,192 --> 00:02:40,144
From Deputy Military
Commissioner Yu's residence.

12
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:47,599
My friend,

13
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:49,520
on this journey west,

14
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:51,080
I can protect you.

15
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,319
Think about it. You're all alone,

16
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:55,120
carrying 100 taels of gold.

17
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,120
Isn't that a lot?

18
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,400
It is.

19
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,000
When we were drinking just now,
I heard you say

20
00:03:05,319 --> 00:03:08,719
that it doesn't matter
if you don't get the gold, right?

21
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,759
Even if I don't want it,

22
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,120
it's none of your business.

23
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,000
Get down here.

24
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,759
Who's that?

25
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:20,840
Heroine.

26
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,360
Put this on.

27
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,080
From Luyao?

28
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,719
From me.

29
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,560
I told you to put it on.

30
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,279
Fang is a spy, too.

31
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,720
I saw the spear

32
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:34,720
in Yu Hou's room before.

33
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:38,360
Though it was wrapped in a cover
and hidden in a corner.

34
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:42,360
Fang is a good person.

35
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:49,199
He's pure and kind-hearted.

36
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:53,879
He doesn't realize
what he's being made to do,

37
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,720
nor does he know what will happen next.

38
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,839
Why would they send someone like him?

39
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,759
Deputy Yu sent him?

40
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,000
Most likely.

41
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:22,759
Is the Deputy Military Commissioner
our enemy, too?

42
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,800
I have many dark thoughts in my heart,

43
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:33,279
but I've never dared to act on them.

44
00:05:36,199 --> 00:05:37,759
What if the General

45
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:41,519
harbors dark thoughts as well?

46
00:05:43,879 --> 00:05:45,120
My father said

47
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,950
the Commander-in-Chief
is the deity of the Northwest.

48
00:05:51,079 --> 00:05:52,519
A deity has no dark thoughts.

49
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,959
We'll know as we keep going.

50
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:08,079
Treat Fang just like before.

51
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,319
Don't blow his cover.

52
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,759
Luyao,

53
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:59,160
are you asleep?

54
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,000
No.

55
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,800
When we were at the Escort Agency,

56
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:10,000
I thought

57
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:13,319
I saw brother-in-law.

58
00:08:15,879 --> 00:08:18,399
Just for a split second.

59
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,040
In the candlelight,

60
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,319
in the blink of an eye,

61
00:08:23,519 --> 00:08:24,759
he was gone.

62
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:28,839
Brother-in-law can't even walk.

63
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:32,240
How could he possibly
come to the Northwest?

64
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,600
I'm really scared.

65
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,039
Don't be scared.

66
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:47,120
I must have mistaken him
for someone else, right?

67
00:08:49,799 --> 00:08:52,159
Never call him
"brother-in-law" ever again.

68
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:55,039
If we die this time,

69
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,320
that will be the end of it all.

70
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,720
If we survive,

71
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,440
we won't go back to Northern Shu either.

72
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:11,759
What an agonizing wait.

73
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:28,840
How long have you been
sitting under the General's armor?

74
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,840
I was about to go to sleep.

75
00:09:34,919 --> 00:09:36,000
Go back where to sleep?

76
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,120
That's the General's bedroom.

77
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,000
I am a General, too.

78
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,159
A guerrilla commander.

79
00:10:00,159 --> 00:10:01,279
Every day,

80
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,759
I brew a pot of medicine

81
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,200
for the General.

82
00:10:14,559 --> 00:10:16,039
I will repeat that.

83
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,440
Every day,

84
00:10:19,159 --> 00:10:20,840
I brew a pot of medicine

85
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,200
for the General.

86
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:27,159
Everyone in Gansu watches

87
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,679
as I finish

88
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,399
brewing the medicine,

89
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:33,399
bring it inside,

90
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,799
and walk all the way

91
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:38,919
to this very spot.

92
00:10:43,639 --> 00:10:45,240
Then, I pour out all the medicine

93
00:10:45,679 --> 00:10:48,039
right here

94
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,279
and walk back out holding

95
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:54,720
the empty golden medicine pot.

96
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,039
Yu Hou,

97
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,720
you can smell it.

98
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,840
This entire patch of sand

99
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,679
reeks of medicine.

100
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,120
Why do I pour out

101
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:18,759
the medicine right here?

102
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,399
Yu Hou,

103
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:24,039
do you understand now?

104
00:11:34,159 --> 00:11:36,159
Don't touch it with your hands.

105
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,360
My poison

106
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:40,000
dissolves bones.

107
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,159
It was poured

108
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,240
over the General,

109
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:54,879
jar after jar.

110
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,879
The General,

111
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,120
piece

112
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:04,840
by piece,

113
00:12:06,679 --> 00:12:08,200
just vanished.

114
00:12:20,679 --> 00:12:22,360
Now, no one knows

115
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,639
that the General is buried here.

116
00:12:28,519 --> 00:12:29,879
Two months ago,

117
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:33,440
a few personal attendants knew.

118
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:37,080
I killed them all.

119
00:13:52,639 --> 00:13:54,320
Luyao, you won't die.

120
00:13:56,679 --> 00:13:57,960
If we don't go back to Sichuan,

121
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:01,080
we'll just go somewhere further.

122
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,799
The further, the better.

123
00:14:06,919 --> 00:14:08,639
Where should we go?

124
00:14:33,799 --> 00:14:35,039
Why aren't you crying out?

125
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:38,480
We've fought until now,
but why didn't you shout?

126
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,080
If you shout a bit louder,

127
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:42,879
the warriors out
on the drill grounds could hear you.

128
00:14:45,879 --> 00:14:48,000
If I tighten my grip just a little,

129
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:49,919
your life

130
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:51,759
will be gone.

131
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:55,919
But you can't be
buried here like the General.

132
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,519
Not because it's too crowded here,

133
00:14:59,120 --> 00:14:59,919
but because

134
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:02,799
the General left
a suit of armor outside.

135
00:15:02,799 --> 00:15:03,519
And you?

136
00:15:03,919 --> 00:15:05,440
You have nothing.

137
00:15:10,039 --> 00:15:12,039
So I'll give you another chance.

138
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,000
Whatever I say,

139
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,919
you repeat it.

140
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,200
Think it through

141
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,919
as you speak.

142
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,080
Speak carefully.

143
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:27,200
Don't make a mistake.

144
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:32,240
A man of his word, true to his actions.

145
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,600
Yu Hou,

146
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,799
you have always been

147
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:40,279
someone who delivers on his promises.

148
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:42,840
That's why the General was fond of you.

149
00:15:45,159 --> 00:15:46,320
The General

150
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,120
is dead.

151
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,039
Say it!

152
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:55,919
The General

153
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,320
is dead.

154
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:02,039
But as long as
the General's armor remains,

155
00:16:03,799 --> 00:16:05,080
the deadly presence

156
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,759
of Gansu remains.

157
00:16:09,679 --> 00:16:11,320
As long as the General's armor remains,

158
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:14,080
the deadly presence

159
00:16:14,519 --> 00:16:15,720
of Gansu remains.

160
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:18,960
If

161
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,440
the imperial court

162
00:16:20,919 --> 00:16:23,399
sends a new General,

163
00:16:25,559 --> 00:16:26,639
and the armor

164
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,000
is no longer there,

165
00:16:30,559 --> 00:16:32,559
we'll be gone, too.

166
00:16:36,736 --> 00:16:38,270
Once the armor is no longer there,

167
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:42,000
we'll be gone, too.

168
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:47,360
After following the General
through life and death for 20 years,

169
00:16:49,039 --> 00:16:52,639
we must make plans for ourselves.

170
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,519
We must make plans

171
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,759
for ourselves.

172
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:08,200
Have you ever considered

173
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:12,599
dying of old age in
this remote desert borderland?

174
00:17:15,319 --> 00:17:16,440
You like

175
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:18,359
Jiangnan silk

176
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:20,160
and frontier incense.

177
00:17:20,759 --> 00:17:22,440
Did you think I didn't know?

178
00:17:23,359 --> 00:17:25,720
Those are far too expensive.

179
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:29,319
They aren't things we ought to possess!

180
00:17:31,559 --> 00:17:33,480
The armor won't stand for long.

181
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:34,920
Soon enough,

182
00:17:35,279 --> 00:17:37,079
someone will strip it down.

183
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,160
Say it.

184
00:17:39,799 --> 00:17:41,359
The armor won't stand for long.

185
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,359
Someone will strip it down.

186
00:17:45,079 --> 00:17:46,640
We must act quickly.

187
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,920
Only gold lasts forever.

188
00:17:51,376 --> 00:17:53,200
Three hundred thousand taels of gold.

189
00:17:53,559 --> 00:17:55,759
You and I split it half and half.

190
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:59,160
I'll go to the Western Regions,

191
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,400
and you

192
00:18:02,319 --> 00:18:03,960
can go to Jiangnan.

193
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,799
One hundred fifty thousand taels of gold

194
00:18:10,016 --> 00:18:11,680
is enough to spend the rest of our lives

195
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,920
wearing the finest silk

196
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:17,000
and seeing the finest dancers.

197
00:18:28,759 --> 00:18:30,079
Half and half.

198
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:42,359
What about Tie Futu?

199
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,039
What about him?

200
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:52,039
Let martial artists handle

201
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,079
martial arts world matters first.

202
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:59,039
Tie Futu thinks he has many experts

203
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:00,784
and can run rampant
across the Northwest.

204
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:03,440
In Gansu, among the twelve guards
and four battalions,

205
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:05,380
sending out just
a single guard of heavy cavalry

206
00:19:05,392 --> 00:19:06,920
could wipe him off.

207
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:39,960
Open the door.

208
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:53,960
Close the door.

209
00:21:14,740 --> 00:21:19,940
(Heisong Post)

210
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:26,160
Are you asleep,

211
00:21:27,039 --> 00:21:27,799
my friend?

212
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:35,359
Why don't you sleep
in the room upstairs?

213
00:21:36,559 --> 00:21:38,480
I can't part with my salt.

214
00:21:39,599 --> 00:21:42,200
It's the finest salt from the Gesa Sea.

215
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,359
Zhang Luyao.

216
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:54,160
Zhang Luyao.

217
00:23:59,599 --> 00:24:01,000
I'm not feeling well.

218
00:24:02,359 --> 00:24:04,440
My Chong and Yang Heel Meridians
are a bit blocked.

219
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:07,319
Before we left Liangzhou,

220
00:24:07,568 --> 00:24:09,590
you said you'd give me
an antidote every five days.

221
00:24:09,599 --> 00:24:10,839
Is that not enough?

222
00:24:13,319 --> 00:24:14,559
Give me a dose first.

223
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:20,359
Power is surging through
my Baihui and Fengchi points.

224
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:25,079
Is it because of
the fighting and drinking?

225
00:24:28,279 --> 00:24:30,480
Drinking does make one
lose their mind and senses.

226
00:25:08,039 --> 00:25:09,759
I borrowed troops as you asked.

227
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:13,039
Don't forget about
giving me the antidote.

228
00:25:14,319 --> 00:25:15,240
Don't speak.

229
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:32,440
When I came up just now,
I felt a chill in my joints.

230
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,440
I even started hallucinating.

231
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,319
What

232
00:25:44,759 --> 00:25:45,759
are you doing here?

233
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:48,640
Watching over my two bags of salt.

234
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,759
Where did you come from,

235
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,119
and where are you headed?

236
00:25:52,599 --> 00:25:54,039
From Xining Guard.

237
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:56,599
Sell salt, buy liquor,

238
00:25:56,599 --> 00:25:57,720
and go back to the Wusu Sea.

239
00:26:09,599 --> 00:26:11,559
Hide if you don't want to die.

240
00:26:12,799 --> 00:26:13,440
Get out.

241
00:26:15,559 --> 00:26:17,160
What about my salt?

242
00:26:18,039 --> 00:26:20,200
We're all in this together,
hunting the criminal.

243
00:26:20,799 --> 00:26:22,200
Don't use me and then throw me away.

244
00:26:23,200 --> 00:26:24,079
Don't speak.

245
00:26:27,079 --> 00:26:28,160
Alright, I'll head down.

246
00:26:29,759 --> 00:26:30,720
Seriously,

247
00:26:31,359 --> 00:26:32,640
I feel dizzy and weak.

248
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:35,720
Wake up the guards.

249
00:26:38,432 --> 00:26:40,000
The person you want to arrest is here.

250
00:26:41,839 --> 00:26:42,799
You go down first.

251
00:26:43,319 --> 00:26:45,440
I'll go from the window
and block both sides.

252
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:52,200
What are you doing?

253
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,079
Dummy, sleeping?

254
00:26:54,079 --> 00:26:55,599
If you're going to sleep, go inside.

255
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:05,920
Who's there?

256
00:27:08,039 --> 00:27:10,000
Why are you staring at me like that?

257
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,119
Fine.

258
00:27:12,359 --> 00:27:13,200
If you won't leave,

259
00:27:13,519 --> 00:27:14,799
then stay right here.

260
00:27:17,799 --> 00:27:18,440
Go.

261
00:27:18,839 --> 00:27:20,200
Wake the men up first.

262
00:27:20,559 --> 00:27:21,000
Yes, sir.

263
00:27:22,319 --> 00:27:23,640
Who are you?

264
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:29,359
Where is the Zhang lady?

265
00:27:32,079 --> 00:27:33,559
In the room up there.

266
00:27:36,119 --> 00:27:38,920
Wait, I'm talking to you. Who are you?

267
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:05,640
My name is Tie Futu.

268
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,880
Step aside, you two.

269
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,119
I opened

270
00:28:24,519 --> 00:28:26,119
the window for you.

271
00:28:28,279 --> 00:28:30,079
Come to the window to talk!

272
00:28:31,839 --> 00:28:33,079
Take a breath.

273
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:40,079
Is power surging through
your Fengchi and Baihui points?

274
00:28:44,279 --> 00:28:46,000
What monster are you?

275
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:52,759
Zhang Luyao,

276
00:28:53,039 --> 00:28:54,720
come over to the window and talk.

277
00:29:16,799 --> 00:29:17,480
Fall.

278
00:29:20,559 --> 00:29:21,559
Down you go.

279
00:29:37,279 --> 00:29:38,480
Arrest the criminals.

280
00:29:39,119 --> 00:29:40,519
Arrest the criminals, Coroner!

281
00:29:40,519 --> 00:29:41,079
Move!

282
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:42,119
Yes, sir!

283
00:29:44,279 --> 00:29:45,119
Don't move.

284
00:29:51,799 --> 00:29:53,119
Don't get in the way

285
00:29:53,680 --> 00:29:55,079
of Futu's work.

286
00:30:00,799 --> 00:30:01,640
Pingping,

287
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:04,759
bring a chair over to the window.

288
00:30:11,799 --> 00:30:13,119
Miss Zhang,

289
00:30:13,799 --> 00:30:16,240
I know you're skilled with poison,

290
00:30:16,799 --> 00:30:18,799
so I poisoned you as well.

291
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:21,880
Luyao,

292
00:30:22,559 --> 00:30:24,960
I don't have any strength left.

293
00:30:25,799 --> 00:30:27,680
For 30 taels of gold,

294
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,200
I hired the Ghost Tycoon

295
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:31,279
and his wife all the way from Fengdu.

296
00:30:32,039 --> 00:30:32,880
In this world,

297
00:30:33,072 --> 00:30:35,270
the Tang Clan isn't
the only one who can use poison.

298
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:36,440
His poison

299
00:30:36,599 --> 00:30:38,640
is far more potent than the Tang Clan's.

300
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,680
If you still don't move,

301
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:44,559
I'm coming up.

302
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:15,559
Miss Zhang,

303
00:31:15,960 --> 00:31:17,000
I poisoned you

304
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:19,759
just so we could have a proper talk.

305
00:31:20,200 --> 00:31:21,359
I won't harm you.

306
00:31:21,599 --> 00:31:23,960
It wasn't easy getting you back here.

307
00:31:28,599 --> 00:31:30,039
Back off!

308
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:52,880
Kill him.

309
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:54,200
He's interrupting me.

310
00:32:01,119 --> 00:32:02,720
Why aren't the Liangzhou guards moving?

311
00:32:03,720 --> 00:32:04,880
Nobody move.

312
00:32:31,079 --> 00:32:32,880
If you hurt the guy,

313
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:35,359
there's nothing left
for us to talk about.

314
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:39,920
Isn't this lad

315
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:41,880
just someone you hired?

316
00:32:42,079 --> 00:32:43,759
His life or death shouldn't matter.

317
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:45,640
Do you want to talk or not?

318
00:32:47,920 --> 00:32:48,640
Don't move.

319
00:32:56,119 --> 00:32:56,960
Speak.

320
00:32:58,400 --> 00:33:00,680
I came here to talk
to you in the first place.

321
00:33:02,039 --> 00:33:02,920
Fang,

322
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,519
come down below the window.

323
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:24,519
Miss Zhang,

324
00:33:25,039 --> 00:33:27,079
people in this world come for profit

325
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,559
and leave for profit.

326
00:33:29,480 --> 00:33:31,039
Life and death pass in a rush,

327
00:33:31,400 --> 00:33:32,799
so don't beat around the bush.

328
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:35,319
Give it to me straight.

329
00:33:37,792 --> 00:33:40,400
Were you the one who placed
the escort order with my family?

330
00:33:41,240 --> 00:33:41,960
Yes.

331
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:46,839
You lured the guardians of the gold
to wipe out my family

332
00:33:48,359 --> 00:33:50,119
just to force me back to help you

333
00:33:50,119 --> 00:33:51,720
identify the poison and track them down?

334
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:54,559
That wasn't it.

335
00:33:57,920 --> 00:34:00,000
The Fengdu Ghost Couple
are right behind me.

336
00:34:02,839 --> 00:34:04,279
Why bother making excuses?

337
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:09,159
I'm not making excuses.

338
00:34:09,328 --> 00:34:11,150
I want to make things
even clearer for you.

339
00:34:11,392 --> 00:34:13,664
The one who placed
the escort order with the Zhangs

340
00:34:14,079 --> 00:34:14,960
was me.

341
00:34:15,680 --> 00:34:16,920
The one who used the poison

342
00:34:18,079 --> 00:34:19,239
was also me.

343
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:23,599
The Zhang Escort Agency is so small.

344
00:34:24,559 --> 00:34:27,079
What if the guardians of the gold
didn't care for it?

345
00:34:28,864 --> 00:34:31,590
It just so happened I had
some poison from the feed on hand,

346
00:34:32,280 --> 00:34:33,880
so I used it along the way

347
00:34:34,360 --> 00:34:37,679
to welcome your return to Liangzhou.

348
00:34:39,648 --> 00:34:41,040
The one placing the escort order

349
00:34:42,079 --> 00:34:43,199
and the one poisoning

350
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:46,280
were both you?

351
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:48,679
That's right.

352
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,079
Both are me.

353
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,719
In broad daylight,

354
00:34:58,840 --> 00:34:59,760
under a clear...

355
00:35:02,599 --> 00:35:04,559
under a clear sky,

356
00:35:05,119 --> 00:35:06,559
you dare to openly talk about

357
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:09,119
murder and robbery like this.

358
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,320
Coroner,

359
00:35:13,536 --> 00:35:15,590
do you still want to go back
to Liangzhou or not?

360
00:35:17,719 --> 00:35:19,840
The official and the outlaw
are in cahoots.

361
00:35:21,679 --> 00:35:22,800
Shut him up.

362
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,360
What are you doing?

363
00:35:37,519 --> 00:35:39,280
Slapping my face?

364
00:35:39,472 --> 00:35:41,600
I am an officer of
the Embroidered Uniform Guard!

365
00:35:48,280 --> 00:35:49,679
We are mortal enemies now, huh?

366
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:55,480
What are you looking at?

367
00:35:56,079 --> 00:35:56,840
My friend,

368
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:58,880
I'm just taking a look

369
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:00,559
and listening in.

370
00:36:04,079 --> 00:36:06,360
Placing the order and
poisoning them were both you,

371
00:36:09,536 --> 00:36:12,080
and it had nothing to do
with the guardians of the gold.

372
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,639
Why tell me all this?

373
00:36:17,568 --> 00:36:19,150
I was planning to head west anyway

374
00:36:19,159 --> 00:36:21,079
to look for the guardians of the gold.

375
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:25,519
Lamp Shade is dead,

376
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:28,639
and having you trailing
behind me is too much trouble.

377
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:31,079
Your father and brothers,

378
00:36:31,559 --> 00:36:33,360
all twenty-seven dead,

379
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:35,840
can't be brought back to life.

380
00:36:36,280 --> 00:36:37,440
The people you hired

381
00:36:37,679 --> 00:36:39,000
are no match for me.

382
00:36:39,559 --> 00:36:40,480
The troops you borrowed

383
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:41,679
won't stand in my way.

384
00:36:42,559 --> 00:36:43,880
Forget about

385
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,440
revenge.

386
00:36:45,599 --> 00:36:47,400
Why not get rich together instead?

387
00:36:48,519 --> 00:36:49,960
We head west together

388
00:36:50,624 --> 00:36:52,590
and track down
the guardians of the gold.

389
00:36:53,159 --> 00:36:53,960
Tell me.

390
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:56,800
Out of 300,000 taels of gold,

391
00:36:57,920 --> 00:36:59,320
I'll give you 30,000 taels.

392
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:00,639
No,

393
00:37:01,039 --> 00:37:02,199
50,000 taels.

394
00:37:03,159 --> 00:37:04,159
That's the max.

395
00:37:05,239 --> 00:37:06,000
Or,

396
00:37:06,760 --> 00:37:07,599
along the way,

397
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:10,800
you can try to take your
revenge on me anytime.

398
00:37:11,719 --> 00:37:13,239
You get a 50,000-tael share,

399
00:37:13,239 --> 00:37:14,880
and you can still seek revenge on me.

400
00:37:16,039 --> 00:37:16,960
But

401
00:37:17,679 --> 00:37:19,639
revenge is one thing.

402
00:37:20,320 --> 00:37:22,440
Don't get in the way of my fortune.

403
00:37:23,199 --> 00:37:24,039
Fang.

404
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:45,480
How can you move?

405
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:47,760
I'm immune to all poisons.

406
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:50,320
I sat still just to hear
what you had to say.

407
00:37:52,624 --> 00:37:54,000
Watch out for her blade.

408
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:55,250
It cuts through iron like clay.

409
00:38:30,039 --> 00:38:30,840
Ghost Tycoon,

410
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:32,599
how are you handling things?

411
00:38:58,320 --> 00:38:59,320
Don't move.

412
00:39:05,159 --> 00:39:06,719
Kill the lad.

413
00:39:08,360 --> 00:39:09,000
Hold on!

414
00:39:09,599 --> 00:39:10,880
This is between my wife and me.

415
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:12,360
Stay out of it.

416
00:39:20,320 --> 00:39:21,280
Fang, hold your breath!

417
00:39:33,584 --> 00:39:35,220
The officers and bandits are in cahoots.

418
00:39:35,880 --> 00:39:37,039
This makes me furious.

419
00:39:38,079 --> 00:39:40,760
Let's see if you dare
to kill an imperial official.

420
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:44,920
So many men are bullying a weak woman.

421
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:56,920
What are you staring at?
Protect Officer Pu.

422
00:39:56,920 --> 00:39:58,480
Go pull the officer back.

423
00:39:58,920 --> 00:39:59,320
Move!

424
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:02,519
Officer.

425
00:40:08,519 --> 00:40:09,880
Miss Zhang,

426
00:40:11,360 --> 00:40:12,599
why bother?

427
00:40:13,519 --> 00:40:14,920
A person as smart as you,

428
00:40:15,039 --> 00:40:17,400
why attempt the impossible?

429
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,280
Catch him.

430
00:40:20,639 --> 00:40:21,519
Slowly...

431
00:40:21,679 --> 00:40:22,320
Gently.

432
00:40:32,639 --> 00:40:34,800
Let's see how long
you can hold your breath.

433
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:36,960
The villains are right here.

434
00:40:37,119 --> 00:40:38,920
Why aren't you from Liangzhou moving?

435
00:40:38,920 --> 00:40:40,560
How will you report back to the Deputy?

436
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:44,400
If I don't die today,

437
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:46,840
those in Liangzhou,
from you to the Deputy,

438
00:40:46,840 --> 00:40:47,400
will...

439
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:52,599
Officer!

440
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:53,639
Wake up, Officer.

441
00:41:00,599 --> 00:41:01,760
Don't hurt her.

442
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:12,360
Fall.

443
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,360
Down you go.

444
00:41:21,408 --> 00:41:22,440
What are you looking at?

445
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,880
Kill him.

446
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:24,119
Capture the Zhang lady.

447
00:43:12,900 --> 00:43:15,500
(Preview of the Next Episode)

448
00:43:16,079 --> 00:43:18,719
Are you also
an accomplice of the Zhang lady?

449
00:43:19,079 --> 00:43:20,199
I wasn't before.

450
00:43:20,320 --> 00:43:21,320
Now, I am.

451
00:43:22,360 --> 00:43:23,559
Good people should live long.

452
00:43:24,079 --> 00:43:27,400
Aren't good people
supposed to kill off all the evil ones?

453
00:43:27,679 --> 00:43:28,440
Flying Eagle,

454
00:43:28,719 --> 00:43:31,119
ask the Qin Demon
of Mount Pingfeng to help me.

455
00:43:31,679 --> 00:43:33,639
I'll pretend last night never happened.

456
00:43:34,039 --> 00:43:35,039
Keep going,

457
00:43:35,519 --> 00:43:36,800
and listen to me.

458
00:43:39,440 --> 00:43:40,159
Your son

459
00:43:41,159 --> 00:43:41,960
has killed before?

460
00:43:41,960 --> 00:43:46,960
=Remnants of Gold=
